":"2. No cambiar sensores individualmente.","textHash":"eee700213f5028e6feea6886ceb04475b5a1eb444e97c68c276d73dcf4c36cff"},{"blockId":"block_033947_847f551fa8","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33947,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"3. Revisar batería y tierras.","textHash":"847f551fa85c7e18961c88c2d0865768d313bd8197a6eec82240be34e5ab15ef"},{"blockId":"block_033948_9094247b6d","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33948,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"4. Leer todos los DTC y agruparlos por circuito común.","textHash":"9094247b6db403e9d58d72f59d6f47b555db1e14c80ce8ef99bc39f19859ce08"},{"blockId":"block_033949_fda6c35b28","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33949,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"5. Medir referencia de 5 V.","textHash":"fda6c35b28825a72c4bdd9e5bc770fbe57d1bb839157a244a013b71c6f19fd76"},{"blockId":"block_033950_fcf7808efd","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33950,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"6. Revisar relé y fusible ECU.","textHash":"fcf7808efde9243640fbcf8cfec92cd18afd76cfb18ef212bf2f452dafb69e6f"},{"blockId":"block_033951_7ac76e7c26","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33951,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"7. Auditar todos los empalmes de la alarma.","textHash":"7ac76e7c265865801c5eb69ed7b033441fadf5c65ca23569c7736910420c2017"},{"blockId":"block_033952_93d267a4ac","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33952,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"8. Buscar cables positivos sin fusible.","textHash":"93d267a4ac79c2a3b5106e2e9f7960f1db13f667f6fbe6c75d07a4496b310bb0"},{"blockId":"block_033953_51bbce2967","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33953,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"9. Buscar empalmes twist-and-tape.","textHash":"51bbce29675437bc762cee3f45b3748b031c66cb97df7231f6c8bb8ec073edd7"},{"blockId":"block_033954_889e2afc7e","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33954,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"10. Ejecutar wiggle test monitorizado.","textHash":"889e2afc7e2c1f141af1f1c1289bf7b5a2917f6015c8c0430c68f8d4b09e4d50"},{"blockId":"block_033955_75476297c6","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33955,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"11. Medir caída bajo carga.","textHash":"75476297c61c35878d2c789b821e27cd39cd513e046cd0c9a921699903b8a591"},{"blockId":"block_033956_bee243dd83","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33956,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"12. Reparar con cable del mismo calibre.","textHash":"bee243dd833c0c2683f6a2be9eb5650fd354a39648dd281d81aa089dd19576c3"},{"blockId":"block_033957_6752a51f55","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33957,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"13. Utilizar terminales o crimps sellados.","textHash":"6752a51f559a43bed1eefa324bf80d1df288d57cbca75d514e8167fec86e401d"},{"blockId":"block_033958_5769faf46a","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33958,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"14. Restaurar grommets y routing.","textHash":"5769faf46a955b2c3ef44f0489674326840c572befbe24df4ef24132379c9883"},{"blockId":"block_033959_300de450c6","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33959,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"15. Confirmar que el fusible original ya no abre.","textHash":"300de450c68420a0070230dc839a33f29d14ff4a49ef3e58d4774f5d5444cea9"},{"blockId":"block_033960_b000522017","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33960,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o033942-aparecen-codigos-de-varios-sensores-y-el-fus","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["7. Sistema eléctrico principal","Cableado y conectividad"],"styleId":"","text":"16. Realizar prueba de ruta.","textHash":"b0005220174c14f94240bd0be9506da8e5871926f92c03f03f0395c48c0d22f9"},{"blockId":"block_033961_1b8acdeda0","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":33961,"parentEntityI